<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
  <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
  <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,38px);margin-top:6px">Event planning, made effortless.</h1>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:16px">Event Ease is a Faisalabad-focused marketplace that brings wedding halls, corporate venues, seminar halls, caterers, photographers, decorators, and bridal &amp; groom wear into one place. Customers discover providers, compare options, and send booking requests, then track every request from their dashboard.</p>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top:16px;font-size:15px">We bring the city's best venues and service providers together in one place, so you can plan any event, big or small, without calling dozens of businesses. Discover, compare, and send a booking request in minutes.</p>
  <h3 style="margin-top:22px;font-size:18px">How it works</h3>
  <ol class="muted" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;padding-left:20px">
    <li>Browse a category or search for a venue or service.</li>
    <li>Open a listing to see details, packages and reviews.</li>
    <li>Send a booking request with your event details.</li>
    <li>The provider reviews and approves or declines the request.</li>
    <li>Track the status any time from your dashboard.</li>
  </ol>
</div></section>
